  "instruction": "look at `loose.brd` in EAGLE, execute the shipped `apply_jlcpcb_2layer.scr` script to load the JLCPCB 2-layer design-rule preset from `jlcpcb_2layer.dru`, then save the board as `jlcpcb.brd`.\n\nRequirements:\n1. `jlcpcb.brd` remains a parseable EAGLE board XML file.\n2. The board contains a `<designrules>` block.\n3. `mdWireWire`, `mdWirePad`, `mdWireVia`, and `mdViaVia` are all at least `0.15 mm`.\n4. `msWidth` is at least `0.15 mm`.\n5. `mdDrill` is at least `0.30 mm`.\n6. `rlMinPadTop`, `rlMinPadInner`, and `rlMinPadBottom` are all at least `0.15 mm`.",
